    <bpmn:process id="W_W52" name="W52. Fleet Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vehicle registration renewal, scheduled maintenance, fuel purchase, driver assignment, route planning review
Frequency: Continuous; daily operations + periodic scheduled maintenance
Volume: ~30–40 owned vehicles (20% of total fleet); remainder 80% third-party (Lalamove, Transportify, contracted carriers)
Owner: Fleet Manager (within Supply Chain team)
Participants: Fleet Manager, Drivers, DC Dispatch, Finance, External carriers
Source: workflow W52 — Fleet Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W52_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W52_Lane1" name="Fleet Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W52_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W52_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W52_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W52_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W52_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W52_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W52_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W52_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W52_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W52_Lane2" name="Driver">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W52_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W52_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W52_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W52_Start4" name="Vehicle registration renewal, scheduled maintenance, fuel purchase, driver assignment…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W52_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W52_Task5" name="Driver assignment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Driver assignment: Fleet Manager assigns drivers to owned vehicles based on route schedule, driver qualifications (LTO license type — professional driver&#x27;s license with restriction codes for heavy vehicles), and duty hour limits
Responsible (R): Fleet Manager
Accountable (A): Supply Chain Manager
Duration: 30 min/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W52_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W52_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W52_Task6" name="Daily pre-trip inspection">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Daily pre-trip inspection: Driver conducts vehicle inspection checklist (tires, brakes, lights, fluid levels, cargo area, safety equipment) before departure; records in system via mobile app; vehicle not cleared for dispatch if critical items fail
Responsible (R): Driver
Accountable (A): Fleet Manager
Duration: 15 min/vehicle/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W52_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W52_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W52_Task7" name="Fuel management">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Fuel management: Driver refuels at designated fuel stations using company fuel card; system captures fuel volume, odometer reading, and cost per transaction; Fleet Manager reviews fuel consumption per vehicle monthly (km/L benchmark per vehicle type; flags vehicles &gt; 15% below benchmark for maintenance investigation)
Responsible (R): Driver / Fleet Manager
Accountable (A): Fleet Manager
Duration: 5 min/refuel + 1 hour/month review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W52_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W52_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W52_Task8" name="Scheduled maintenance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Scheduled maintenance: Fleet Manager maintains maintenance calendar per vehicle based on manufacturer intervals (typically every 5,000–10,000 km or 3–6 months): (a) oil change and basic service, (b) tire rotation and replacement, (c) brake inspection, (d) annual comprehensive service; system alerts Fleet Manager 1 week before service due
Responsible (R): Fleet Manager
Accountable (A): DC Manager
Duration: Per schedule</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W52_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W52_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W52_Task9" name="Unscheduled repair">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Unscheduled repair: Driver reports vehicle issue; Fleet Manager assesses severity: (a) minor — schedule repair at next available slot, substitute 3PL for pending deliveries, (b) major — vehicle taken out of service, substitute vehicle or 3PL arranged
Responsible (R): Fleet Manager
Accountable (A): DC Manager
Duration: 30 min/occurrence</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W52_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W52_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W52_Task10" name="Maintenance or repair executed at company-approved workshop per region; Fleet…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Maintenance or repair executed at company-approved workshop per region; Fleet Manager approves work order and cost; system tracks maintenance history per vehicle
Responsible (R): Fleet Manager
Accountable (A): DC Manager
Duration: Varies</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W52_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W52_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W52_Task11" name="Vehicle registration &amp; insurance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Vehicle registration &amp; insurance: Fleet Manager maintains calendar for LTO registration renewal (annual per vehicle), CTPL insurance renewal, and comprehensive insurance; system alerts 60 days before expiry; vehicles with expired registration blocked from dispatch
Responsible (R): Fleet Manager
Accountable (A): DC Manager
Duration: 30 min/vehicle/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W52_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W52_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W52_Task12" name="Route performance review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Route performance review: monthly, Fleet Manager reviews route metrics per vehicle: km driven, fuel efficiency, delivery punctuality (on-time % per W4 SLA), maintenance cost per km; identifies vehicles with declining performance for maintenance escalation or replacement planning
Responsible (R): Fleet Manager
Accountable (A): Supply Chain Manager
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W52_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W52_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W52_Task13" name="3PL carrier performance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: 3PL carrier performance: Fleet Manager monitors third-party carrier performance per W19 (on-time delivery, damage rate, cost per delivery) in coordination with DC Dispatch; quarterly carrier review per W44 vendor scorecard methodology
Responsible (R): Fleet Manager / DC Dispatch
Accountable (A): Supply Chain Manager
Duration: Per W19/W44</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W52_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W52_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W52_Task14" name="Vehicle replacement planning">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 10: Vehicle replacement planning: annually, Fleet Manager evaluates vehicles &gt; 5 years or &gt; 300,000 km for replacement; submits capex request per W21; considers total cost of ownership (maintenance cost trajectory, fuel efficiency decline, reliability) vs. new vehicle cost plus financing
Responsible (R): Fleet Manager
Accountable (A): Supply Chain Manager
Duration: Annual (4 hours)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W52_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W52_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W52_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W52_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W52_Annotation16">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-250 (ensure controlled execution — DC Inbound Operations (PA-04.1).) | - operational: Fleet Manager (within Supply Chain team) review and approval gate
Owner: Fleet Manager (within Supply Chain team)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W52_Assoc17" sourceRef="W52_Annotation16" targetRef="W52_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
